      "id": "claim_f952c747bd6a470ab9e73f1ecc995769",
      "statement": "useTask runs a four-stage polling schedule: immediate fetch on mount, a 2 s retry interval while the task is not found and attemptCount < 3 (race-condition window), a 5 s steady-state interval once isLoading is false, and an immediate 500 ms refetch when logs indicate the dev server is running but task.sandboxUrl is still missing.",
