    {
      "id": "claim_4cb5f19347924546a5e856533e7142db",
      "statement": "useTask only surfaces the error 'Task not found' after at least three failed attempts (covering ~6 s of retry), so the brief window where the client navigates to /tasks/[id] before the POST /api/tasks row insert completes never produces a false \"Task not found\" flash.",
