      "statement": "The dev-server fast-path in useTask is keyed off the exact log strings 'Development server is running' or 'Development server started' emitted by lib/sandbox/creation.ts and start-sandbox route, and uses a pendingSandboxRefetchRef guard so it fires at most once per pending sandboxUrl.",
